Web games destruction and monetisation platform Playgama has revealed that developers using its platform collectively earned more than $1 million between January and September 2026.&nbsp;

Weekly developer earnings have seen significant growth since the beginning of the year, rising from approximately $11,000 in January to more than $50,000 by early October.&nbsp; ... [<a href="https://www.pocketgamer.biz/playgama-developers-earn-over-1m-in-first-nine-months-of-2026/">MORE</a>]
