Yes2Games has surpassed 25.1 million plays and 2.2 million hours of playtime across its portfolio of games distributed through YouTube Playables.&nbsp;

Its portfolio includes several titles from Australian games developer Halfbrick, including Fruit Ninja, Jetpack Joyride and Dan the Man.&nbsp; ... [<a href="https://www.pocketgamer.biz/yes2games-surpasses-25-million-plays-across-its-youtube-playables-portfolio/">MORE</a>]
