Softgames is celebrating 20 years in the games industry, having moved between platforms and business models as the market has evolved over the years.&nbsp;

Softgames operates more than 500 casual instant games across platforms such as Meta, Google and Microsoft. It is also looking to expand its mobile business and acquire more casual games, following its purchase of Funday Games&rsquo; instant games back catalogue.&nbsp; ... [<a href="https://www.pocketgamer.biz/softgames-ceo-relying-on-one-platform-or-one-model-is-risky/">MORE</a>]
